SUMMARY:Summer Passport Challenge Registration NOW OPEN (Ages 10 &up)
DESCRIPTION:\n\nYouth Passport Challenge & Reading Bookmark Challenge (Ages 
 10 and up)\n\nRegistration begins online on June 12th. The Grand Prize draw 
 will take place on Aug 25th @ noon.\n\nRegister online or in-person from 
 June 12th until Aug 25th at noon. Visit your local branch to pick up your 
 passport booklet of activities and get started on your summer challenge. 
 Don't forget to visit the library to pick up your prizes as you complete 
 each 'Challenge Stop' on your passport booklet. Hand in your completed 
 booklet so it can be entered into the Grand Prize draw on Aug 25th. FYI 
 Reading Bookmarks will be available throughout the summer\, you are welcome 
 to complete as many as you like. Take & Make Kits will be available only 
 while supplies last. For further details\, email Elaine at 
 ehamerton@clearview.ca\n\nSee separate registration dates for the Youth 
 Summer Workshops.
LOCATION:Creemore Branch\, New Lowell Branch\, Stayner Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Elaine Hamerton":MAILTO:ehamerton@clearview.ca
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-8690-4026194
URL:https://clearviewlibrary.libcal.com/event/4026194
END:VEVENT
