SUMMARY:Baby Rhyme Time with EarlyON
DESCRIPTION:Register: 
 https://www.missioninc.com/cso/simcoe/en-ca/earlyon/events/9389_20260825T133000Z\nTuesday\, 
 August 25\, 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 to 2:30 PM\n\nTuesday\, September 1\, 
 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 to 2:30 PM\n\nTuesday\, September 8\, 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 
 to 2:30 PM\n\nTuesday\, September 15\, 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 to 2:30 
 PM\n\nTuesday\, September 22\, 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 to 2:30 PM\n\nTuesday\, 
 September 29\, 2026\n\n-\n\n1:30 to 2:30 PM\n\nPrenatal/Birth to 12 months 
 of age\n\nEarlyON Child and Family Centre - Clearview Library - Sunnidale 
 Branch\n\n5237 County Rd 9\, New Lowell\, ON L0M 1N0\n\nPre-Registration 
 REQUIRED\n\nIntroduce your baby to the sounds of language through rhymes\, 
 songs and simple stories. For babies - newborn to 12 months - with a 
 caregiver.
