SUMMARY:Giant Floor Water Map Leaves Stayner Branch
DESCRIPTION:Last chance to explore our Giant World Water Map!\n\nOur map 
 from Ocean Week Canada is leaving this Friday! Patrons have loved this 
 fun\, interactive experience\, and we’ve been so excited to have 
 something this special at our Stayner Branch. 💙\n\nStop in and explore 
 before it’s gone!
